# Files Docker may send to the build (decision D34).
# Whitelist: ignore everything, then allow only what the Dockerfile copies. Without this, every
# build would upload the 2GB of raw data and the DVC cache to Docker.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!data/serve
!data/content/neighbors.parquet
!models/ranker.txt
**/__pycache__
